只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent trajectory governance & anomaly diagnosis plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): multi-branch trajectory trees, loop-deadlock / invalid-retry / goal-drift detection, cost attribution, alerts, one-click interrupt & breakpoint fork, independent GUI tab. Zero kernel modification.","id":"gh:1334355126","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-trajectory-governance","slug":"dfycaly98931680/dsh-trajectory-governance","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","trajectory"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent trajectory governance & anomaly diagnosis plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): multi-branch traj"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ectory trees, loop-deadlock / invalid-retry / goal-drift detection, cost attribution, alerts, one-cl"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ick interrupt & breakpoint fork, independent GUI tab. Zero kernel modification."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-trajectory-governance"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Agent trajectory governance & anomaly diagnosis for DeepSeek Harness (dsh).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Rebuilds the flat `session/event` log into a **structured, multi-branch trajectory\ntree**, keeps **o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"bservation-layer snapshots**, and runs **three temporal anomaly\nstrategies** (loop deadlock / invali"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"d retry / goal drift) with results mounted on\ntree nodes and surfaced in an **independent GUI tab**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Zero kernel modification · consume-only event subscription · observation-layer\n> snapshots (no con"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"trol-plane rollback) · independent SQLite storage · never\n> overwrites the official Trajectory view."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The official Trajectory page is a **flat raw-event log**. For long-running agent\ntasks (dozens of tu"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"rns, subagents, forks) you cannot see:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- which tool call belongs to which sub-task / subagent / fork branch,\n- where the agent started drif"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ting from the original goal,\n- whether it is looping in place burning tokens (deadlock / invalid ret"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" from the original goal,\n- whether it is looping in place burning tokens (deadlock / invalid retry)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This plugin is an **upper observation & reasoning layer**: it consumes committed\nevents and derives "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"structure, snapshots, and diagnoses — it never steers,\nintercepts, or rolls back the agent. Both vie"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"snapshots, and diagnoses — it never steers,\nintercepts, or rolls back the agent. Both views coexist."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Aspect | Official Trajectory | dsh-trajectory-governance |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| View | flat raw event log | structured multi-branch trajectory tree |\n| Lineage | none | parent/ch"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ild + fork/subagent branches (derived implicitly) |\n| Snapshots | no | observation-layer snapshots ("},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nodeId + context hash + branchId) |\n| Diagnosis | no | loop_deadlock / invalid_retry / goal_drift wi"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"th confidence + suggestions |\n| Storage | host storage | plugin-private SQLite (`~/.dsh-trajectory-g"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"overnance/`) |\n| Behavior | — | consume-only; never schedules, forks, or rewinds the agent |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Data flow: `session/event` (durable, post-commit) → normalized + persisted →\ntree/snapshot/diagnosis"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" services → JSON API → the GUI tab. The diagnosis engine\nruns **asynchronously** on an interval (inc"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"remental watermark + tail overlap) and\nnever blocks the agent loop."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Requires dsh `>= 0.1.0-rc.6`. Two ways:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Bundle (published / git):**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A git install fetches sources, so the package ships a `prepare` build; pnpm\nrequires an explicit all"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ow-list for it (add the printed key to the profile's\n`pnpm-workspace.yaml`, then re-run):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Alternatively install a built tarball (`pnpm pack`) — no build permission needed."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Dev overlay (no pnpm):**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Then restart the web app. You should see `[trajectory-governance] loaded;\nstorage=... sessions=N eve"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"nts=M anomalies=K` in the logs."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"1. Run any agent task in the GUI (ideally a long one).\n2. Open the **轨迹治理 / Trajectory Governance** "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"tab (a separate `conversation.view`\nentry — the official Trajectory tab is untouched).\n3. Pick a ses"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"sion: the tree renders with **branch badges** (subagent/fork),\n**snapshot marks (★)**, and **red-hig"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"hlighted anomaly ranges (⚠)**.\n4. Click a node for the raw event + mounted diagnosis report (type, c"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"onfidence,\nseverity, description, suggestion).\n5. Use the snapshot bar to capture checkpoints at any"},{"id":"p26s6","text":" node, list them, and jump\nback; delete stale branches via the API/CLI."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"CLI inspection utilities (against the plugin's own SQLite):"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin row accepts `config` (all optional; deep-merged over defaults):"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Full schema: `DIAGNOSIS_CONFIG_SCHEMA` in `src/diagnose/config.ts`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Alerts & stop-loss (v0.2)"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"When a NEW anomaly is detected (confidence ≥ `alerts.minConfidence`), the plugin:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. emits `trajectory/anomaly` on the Cordis bus (ecosystem notification plugins\ncan subscribe) and P"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"OSTs a text webhook if configured — the message is in\n**stop-loss language**: type, confidence, and "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"how much tokens/money/time the\nrange already consumed (from official `assistant/message.usage`);\n2. "},{"id":"p35s4","text":"the GUI tab polls `/api/alerts`, shows a desktop notification (browser\nNotification API, permission "},{"id":"p35s5","text":"button in the bar), and pins abnormal sessions\non top of the dropdown sorted by wasted tokens;\n3. of"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"fers a **one-click interrupt** (`POST /api/actions/interrupt`) which calls\nthe official `agent.cance"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"l` capability — never a monkey-patch. Default tier\nis `notify`; `auto-stop` (loop deadlock only, con"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"fidence ≥ 0.9) can be\nconfigured for unattended setups."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Breakpoints & waste reports (v0.3)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"**Breakpoint exit — the legitimate lightweight \"rollback\".** Instead of a\ncontrol-plane rewind (alre"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ady covered by dsh-turn-rewind),\nthis plugin offers a *diagnosis-driven restart*: at any snapshot / "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"anomaly\nstart / selected node, **\"branch a new session here\"** resolves the target down\nto the neare"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"st stable `turn/end` boundary and calls the **official\n`ctx.sessions.fork(source, boundary)`** — a f"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"resh child session seeded at that\npoint. It never touches workspace files, keeps the observation-lay"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"er stance,\nand turns \"you wasted money here\" into a one-click action."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**Waste attribution report** — not another usage-stats dashboard (that niche is\nsaturated): it answe"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"rs the attribution question nobody else does, *\"which\nsessions wasted tokens/money, on which anomaly"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"tribution question nobody else does, *\"which\nsessions wasted tokens/money, on which anomaly types\"*:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Both are also reachable from the tab (\"浪费报告\" / \"本会话报告\" buttons)."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Quick demo (reproduce loop deadlock & goal drift)"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Instant (no waiting for a real loop):** seed a synthetic session into the\nlive store, refresh the "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"tab, pick `demo-session`:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"You should see a tree with red-highlighted `loop_deadlock` (5 identical tool\ncalls) and a severe `go"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"al_drift` range, plus a snapshot mark (★)."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
